   "html_text": "The precision problem of mathematicals is similar in the case of geometrical entities and units (see Section 6). Consider, for example, Plato's discussion of incompatible features of a finger as presenting one or two things to sight. Aristotle deals with the problem in his discussion of measure (see Section 10.1). The separability problem is the same as for geometry (see Section 6). The plurality problem of mathematicals (Section 6) is similar in the case of geometrical entities and units, with ",
